OL,3,GNEWSAHospital recognised for tiny
OL,4,Apacemaker work
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital that has implanted tiny
OL,7,Fpacemakers for 10 years has been
OL,8,Frecognised as a "centre of excellence".
OL,10,FNorthampton General Hospital said the
OL,11,Fhonour, bestowed by the manufacturer,
OL,12,Fwas for the way "it has pioneered" the
OL,13,Ffitting of the leadless pacemaker and
OL,14,Ffor training other teams around the UK.
OL,16,FThe device is 93% smaller than
OL,17,Ftraditional pacemakers, weighs about
OL,18,Ftwo grams and can be inserted in about
OL,19,F20 minutes.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
